# Scenario "staff-credits" (US, milestones 6 and 9, issues 1 and 5): the staff-credits THP movie, reached without an
# advanced save. The stage 10 script plays the movie as soon as the stage starts, with no condition, so it is enough
# to load any save into stage 10: tools/run.py --stage staff-credit replaces the stage stored in the save once, at
# the restore (game.toml, [stage]). Title screen -> Load Game -> file 1 -> the movie (about 116 s) -> the game goes
# back to the player's home stage (next morning).
# Run it with a user folder holding a US save in slot 1 (any save; recorded with a 47-minute save):
#   py -3 tools/run.py chibi-robo --version GGTE01 --stage staff-credit --user-seed <folder with saves/> \
#     --scenario games/chibi-robo/scenarios/play/GGTE01/staff-credits.scn
# Checkpoints: every 10 frames around the start and the end of the movie, every 60 frames in between (the VI
# field of each checkpoint gives the cadence), 30 consecutive frames in the middle (each frame of the movie is shown).
# Not run by tools/ab.py (progression scenario). No game data here: buttons, frame numbers and names only.
# Recorded on GGTE01 (cycle clock, RTC 800000000).
name staff-credits
description Any save loaded into stage 10 (--stage staff-credit): the staff-credits THP movie, then back to the game (US).
version GGTE01
window 0
input  450 A       # health and safety warning
input 1600 A       # title screen: Load Game
input 1850 A       # load file 1
check 1800 load-file-select
